  "theory": "For a linear relativistic massless retarded 3D wave Green function response to a harmonic source, G_omega(r)\u221de^(i omega r/c)/r. Relative to static the delay is omega r/c. Massive scalar KG Green is G_omega\u221dexp[-r sqrt(lambda^-2-(omega/c)^2)]/r for omega<c/lambda, oscillatory above the mass threshold.",
